		"outputs": [
			{
				"name": "EntityBehavior",
				"type": "markup",
				"description": "The end-to-end panel for the shown entity, with scenario outcomes, duration, reasons and navigation: a before/after comparison when the shown behavior is in commit mode and the scope has a parent, otherwise one run, or an Evidence missing message when no end-to-end result is recorded. It reads artifacts when none were supplied, shows Reading the recorded results… while they load, shows Behavior unknown when reading them is rejected, ignores a completion whose row-hash signature no longer matches, and shows the passing Behavior unchanged or Current behavior verdict only when the results pass."
			}
		],
